{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"hekiryuu","id":"237577351532249110","is_bot":0,"username":"hekiryuu"},"author_id":"237577351532249110","channel_id":"746645778352832545","content":"what if the \"Dragon Sized Sandwiches\" (direct name from one of copper's posts) can only be eaten once a day (maybe week if they are cheap), as they are so filling, but they contain something like lesser restoration, since his sandwiches were such a comfort?  spit balling ideas, but i poked around the ol server, and those one handed meals seemed to be used to make him and others feel better.  a description like this might work:\n\"This Dragon Sized Sandwich fills the person eating it with the warmth of a hearth on a cold winters day. The weight of a thick blanket on a dark and stormy night.  The light of dawn after a sea of trouble.  It fills them, sustaining their body, and warming them down to their very bones\"\n\ntho a custom effect might be cooler and more appropriate, its basically the first thing that came to my mind","created_at":"2021-03-02T13:49:41.520000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"816306272159793242","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
