{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"hekiryuu","id":"237577351532249110","is_bot":0,"username":"hekiryuu"},"author_id":"237577351532249110","channel_id":"746645778352832545","content":"So a state of the game discussion needs to happen.  We currently have 5 DMs who are writing plot content for s4.  Rob is only doing the crafting system.  We had discussed turning the City into superhero lvl 20 chadding.  But with another borough without DMs, this raises some issues.  Currently, Radar, JJ, Mariam, DMD, and Heki are the ones doing all the plot writing.  Its unsure if the 6 of us could reliably run content for all 5 boroughs, even if we could write it (for instance, although I’m available most days, due to working two jobs, I have to sleep at nights when possible and am not generally available for the evening events, but Crane has assured he is going to help run content, he just hasn't been available to help write).  With only a couple months left to get everything written, finalized, and the server setup, a discussion now of what to do needs to happen.  Radar doesn’t want to spread any of us thinner than we already are (though we might have to depending).  So a few ideas he suggested are:","created_at":"2021-03-22T17:01:07.147000Z","edited_at":"2021-03-22T17:02:08.857000Z","id":"823602203683192872","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"hekiryuu","id":"237577351532249110","is_bot":0,"username":"hekiryuu"},"author_id":"237577351532249110","channel_id":"746645778352832545","content":"we could trying talking to a couple mods we know are DMs normally for smaller groups, and ask them if they could step in as DMs.  This might get us a couple more people that could write and run, but we would likely lose some time trying to read them in on everything.\n\nWe could write all content in a way that we could have mods help run it or run it with minimal work on our part as the server is running.  This would take a lot more effort now, and we would all have to band together to give the wastes content.\n\nWe could move to 3 weeks, possibly with more roleplay intensive weeks (ones without any scheduled events) between.  Those three weeks would be the 3 boroughs we currently have, at one a week, with the other areas that players could interact with, but nothing would be scheduled there.\n\nWe could put it off a year, giving us plenty of time to work everything out without having to press or rush for anything, but that might also kill the game and any momentum it has.\n\nThese were some of the ideas Radar and I had, but there are likely more.  We could do one or multiple of these.  If you have any ideas, please mention them.","created_at":"2021-03-22T17:01:18.285000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"823602250399875093","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
