{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"746645778352832545","content":"Agreed. But I'd really like to hear from some of the other voices involved before we start making decisions about anything.","created_at":"2021-03-22T21:45:38.969000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"823673808094494750","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"D (they/them)","id":"692746345387130900","is_bot":0,"username":"nonbianarydarry"},"author_id":"692746345387130900","channel_id":"746645778352832545","content":"Don't put it off, we can do it! I'll be much freer soon with more time to sit down and crank out content. If yall think we need to pull in mods we can do that. I don't think it'd take that long to fill everyone in and am totally willing to help with that. Let's set up a meeting time regardless to talk. I'm free Sunday? Possibly tomorrow night as well.","created_at":"2021-03-22T22:28:25.685000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"823684573681811476","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DCJJ","id":"629235245291667476","is_bot":0,"username":"dcjj"},"author_id":"629235245291667476","channel_id":"746645778352832545","content":"Very interesting ideas. I personally don’t think we should push it back a year. I think we’d be able to make it.\n\nAlso if there are too many burrows, we could keep it at 3, then just spend all 5 weeks in those burrows. That way we don’t have to worry about creating any more areas, and we are able to keep the game up for the length of time that was wanted","created_at":"2021-03-22T22:30:40.200000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"823685137878220882","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
