{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"746645778352832545","content":"I'm still a bit torn. 3 weeks 3 boroughs( I think thats still 7 adventures per pair of writers) or 5 weeks 3 boroughs (which adds another 14 days for the 6 of us to divide up)? 6 dms would bring us back to the 2 per borough per week format that made 5 weeks a logical choice. Extending to 5 weeks with three boroughs means each pairing is responsible a bit more work.","created_at":"2021-03-22T22:47:17.277000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"823689319922925629","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
